      "question": "Mouse pads ----- our redesigned company logo will be distributed after the workshop.",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "topic": "语法与词汇",
      "keywords": "grammar vocabulary collocation",
      "answer_explain": "主句已有 will be distributed，空格部分应修饰 Mouse pads。鼠标垫展示标志，用主动意义的 displaying，后接宾语 our redesigned company logo。must display 会另起谓语；to be displayed、being displayed 是被动形式，不能再这样带 logo 作为 display 的宾语。",
